                            <comment id="15299967" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Wed, 25 May 2016 12:24:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;LinkedHashMap of (requestId, GridFutureAdapter) is replaced with &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheQueryManager.CanceledKeyMap&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
It is used to prevent put new key/value pair into the map when the cancel message has been already processed.&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
